<title>USA: Hussey copper price drops to 115 cents/lb Aug 15.</title>
<headline>Hussey copper price drops to 115 cents/lb Aug 15.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hussey Copper Ltd said its contained copper price was down five cents to 115.00 cents per lb.effective with shipments of Aug 15. ((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
